WEBVTT

00:00:09.083 --> 00:00:12.083
Excel Saga is already in its second half!

00:00:12.083 --> 00:00:14.125
When are you going
to quit bungling around?!

00:00:14.125 --> 00:00:17.125
What a disgrace! This is pitiful!

00:00:17.125 --> 00:00:18.875
Why don't you guys...

00:00:19.875 --> 00:00:21.458
And you're eating stew.

00:00:22.292 --> 00:00:24.542
What are we going to
do with this anime hell?

00:00:24.542 --> 00:00:27.417
Should I have the Great Will of
the Macrocosm do a reset?

00:00:27.417 --> 00:00:30.125
Oh, no! I'm mixing
fact and fiction all up!

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:32.125
If we don't gain popularity,
it'll mean my head.

00:00:32.125 --> 00:00:35.125
Oh, how to say this?
We'll be in all sorts of trouble!

00:00:39.292 --> 00:00:40.875
Sir! Sir, have mercy on me!

00:00:40.875 --> 00:00:44.333
Give me permission to introduce
a new character! I beg you!

00:00:46.917 --> 00:00:49.042
"Koshi Rikdo"

00:00:50.042 --> 00:00:53.167
Now even Hell will be Heaven!

00:00:53.167 --> 00:00:54.792
Ain't my problem.

00:01:05.625 --> 00:01:09.500
<i>Sore wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:13.458
<i>Ai wa sore ja nai</i>

00:01:13.458 --> 00:01:21.333
<i>Aishite iru kedo aisarete wa inai</i>

00:01:21.333 --> 00:01:25.208
<i>Kesshite ai ja nai</i>

00:01:25.208 --> 00:01:29.292
<i>Ketsu wa ai ja nai</i>

00:01:29.292 --> 00:01:37.000
<i>Aisaretai keredo motometari wa shinai</i>

00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:41.708
<i>Kono mi sasagete inochi nagedashi</i>

00:01:41.708 --> 00:01:45.750
<i>Wakime mo furazu tada hitasura ni</i>

00:01:45.750 --> 00:01:49.667
<i>Damashite sukashite yokohairi</i>

00:01:49.667 --> 00:01:52.917
<i>Tanin o fumitaoshi keri o kamashite</i>

00:01:52.917 --> 00:01:55.083
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:55.083 --> 00:01:57.000
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:57.000 --> 00:01:58.875
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>
<i>(Tonzura koite!)</i>

00:01:58.875 --> 00:02:00.792
<i>Tonzura koite!</i>

00:02:00.792 --> 00:02:05.625
<i>Banana no kawa de korondemo</i>

00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.750
<i>Sore wa subete ano kata no tame</i>

00:02:08.750 --> 00:02:13.375
<i>Shiite iu nara sore wa kitto</i>

00:02:13.375 --> 00:02:21.208
<i>Ai to iu na no chuuseishin</i>

00:02:30.875 --> 00:02:33.875
Sorry, but wait here for a while.

00:02:33.875 --> 00:02:35.375
Very good, Sir.

00:02:36.167 --> 00:02:39.125
Although if you have time,
I won't mind if you come with me.

00:02:39.125 --> 00:02:42.125
I'm afraid that I must respectfully decline.

00:02:42.125 --> 00:02:43.458
I-I see.

00:02:50.500 --> 00:02:53.167
Do not get involved
more than is necessary.

00:02:54.417 --> 00:02:55.792
"Public OO Midori Park"

00:02:55.917 --> 00:02:59.958
That is the rule by which
you survive in this town.

00:02:59.958 --> 00:03:01.625
Yes, Ma'am.

00:03:03.458 --> 00:03:05.167
How far are you going to dig?

00:03:05.167 --> 00:03:08.625
Until it gets a lot more...

00:03:08.625 --> 00:03:10.125
<i>Je t'aime</i>...

00:03:13.875 --> 00:03:15.417
<i>Mon amie</i>.

00:03:19.000 --> 00:03:20.667
Excellent.

00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:24.083
One of the top locations
in the city, isn't it?

00:03:24.083 --> 00:03:27.000
Am I disturbing you?

00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.667
Yes, very much so.

00:03:28.667 --> 00:03:34.375
Am I dis-tur-bing you?!

00:03:34.375 --> 00:03:36.375
No, not at all.

00:03:37.292 --> 00:03:40.083
Tell me the situation on that one issue.

00:03:52.917 --> 00:03:54.583
Please continue.

00:03:54.583 --> 00:03:57.792
I believe I placed the
order over a month ago.

00:03:57.792 --> 00:04:00.625
My work must be perfect.

00:04:00.625 --> 00:04:02.125
Meaning...

00:04:02.875 --> 00:04:04.458
Here I go!

00:04:12.750 --> 00:04:14.333
Please continue.

00:04:14.333 --> 00:04:16.958
You have not worked on it at all?

00:04:16.958 --> 00:04:18.875
That is what it would mean.

00:04:18.875 --> 00:04:20.458
We have no time to waste in this situation.

00:04:20.458 --> 00:04:23.458
Somehow, there is no reason,
but I just have this feeling.

00:04:29.542 --> 00:04:32.542
I understand. I will have
it for you by noon tomorrow.

00:04:33.250 --> 00:04:36.250
Eri-<i>chan</i>, it's snack time.
Let's go home.

00:04:36.250 --> 00:04:39.750
Okay! So what's today's snack?

00:04:39.750 --> 00:04:41.917
I don't know, I guess we'll find out.

00:04:41.917 --> 00:04:44.833
I played with Yotchan
today on the slide.

00:04:44.833 --> 00:04:46.250
--Since this is a request

00:04:46.250 --> 00:04:47.333
--Really?
--grom none other than my honored teacher,

00:04:47.333 --> 00:04:47.583
--It was really fun!

00:04:47.583 --> 00:04:50.542
--I will respond at genius express speed.
--It was really fun!

00:04:50.542 --> 00:04:52.583
Re-Really.

00:04:52.583 --> 00:04:56.833
Also, regarding the several black
boxes that I received from you,

00:04:56.833 --> 00:04:59.417
I can only say that I am impressed.

00:04:59.417 --> 00:05:02.250
I have some pride too,

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:05.042
so I shall respond with
completion and perfection.

00:05:05.042 --> 00:05:06.542
Tomorrow, then.

00:05:12.500 --> 00:05:17.833
Hail,

00:05:17.833 --> 00:05:20.792
Ilpala

00:05:20.792 --> 00:05:23.667
"To Mr. Watanabe"
"Excel Saga #14"   "AR Scripts"

00:05:25.750 --> 00:05:27.083
zzo!

00:05:27.792 --> 00:05:32.125
It's as if that length speaks
your level of loyalty to ACROSS.

00:05:32.125 --> 00:05:36.125
However, remember that all
things should be done in moderation.

00:05:36.125 --> 00:05:37.625
Please pardon me.

00:05:38.333 --> 00:05:41.958
By the way,
I do not see any sign of Excel.

00:05:41.958 --> 00:05:44.667
Senior Excel is...

00:05:44.667 --> 00:05:47.833
Do you mean to tell me she
has been missing since last time?

00:05:47.833 --> 00:05:50.625
Yes, it is just as you said.

00:05:50.625 --> 00:05:53.625
And I had an important plan
to communicate today.

00:05:54.375 --> 00:05:56.750
I'm okay!

00:05:56.750 --> 00:05:57.625
But my goodness!

00:05:57.625 --> 00:06:00.167
Last time, they said things like
Year-End Party and The New Year,

00:06:00.167 --> 00:06:02.000
but in actuality,
it was just a review episode!

00:06:02.000 --> 00:06:04.292
Did it degenerate into a drastic
measure from a pressured job site?

00:06:04.292 --> 00:06:06.167
Or was it a blast from an
undeclared reduction of funds?

00:06:06.167 --> 00:06:07.708
Or just an episode made
in a slipshod manner?

00:06:07.708 --> 00:06:10.125
Agonizing over this and that,
and having grown as a person,

00:06:10.125 --> 00:06:12.667
I have successfully returned
alive from the brink of death!

00:06:12.667 --> 00:06:15.500
I have discovered a new route!

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:17.833
Senior, I am glad you are safe.

00:06:20.500 --> 00:06:22.625
And so, I regret it
more deeply than the ocean,

00:06:22.625 --> 00:06:24.125
since I'm about a week late.

00:06:24.125 --> 00:06:26.458
I was sort of on the
ocean floor until just now

00:06:26.458 --> 00:06:29.042
and I was about to drop
to the bottom of the food chain,

00:06:29.042 --> 00:06:31.000
but thanks to the
way adverse tide works,

00:06:31.000 --> 00:06:34.167
I arrived here by brute force
with my wonderful homing instincts

00:06:34.167 --> 00:06:38.500
and so I don't think
I deserve to be called tardy!

00:06:39.833 --> 00:06:44.208
Please brief Excel later
when she has calmed down.

00:06:44.208 --> 00:06:45.708
Oh, yes, Sir.

00:06:47.208 --> 00:06:50.250
Now, I will impart Idealistic
Organization ACROSS's

00:06:50.250 --> 00:06:53.042
City Conquest Plan #4226!

00:07:02.958 --> 00:07:08.333
This is ACROSS's
City Conquest Plan #4226.

00:07:15.042 --> 00:07:17.208
Th-This is a hell of a simulation!

00:07:18.083 --> 00:07:20.792
Where?! Where is he?!

00:07:34.292 --> 00:07:36.250
"Peaceful Slumber"

00:07:40.917 --> 00:07:45.417
It will soon be
the appointed time, but...

00:07:45.417 --> 00:07:47.292
How unusual of him.

00:07:47.292 --> 00:07:49.375
He's a perfectionist,
whose principle is to be punctual,

00:07:49.375 --> 00:07:52.083
but he has not shown up.

00:07:55.417 --> 00:07:59.417
Perhaps it was just too
difficult to finish it in one day.

00:08:01.583 --> 00:08:05.333
Perhaps he'll make me anxious
and then come in through the window.

00:08:05.333 --> 00:08:07.375
But he would never...

00:08:13.875 --> 00:08:16.792
Gojo Shioji has rushed
to arrive at the appointed time.

00:08:16.792 --> 00:08:18.125
'Ello!

00:08:18.125 --> 00:08:20.375
O-Okay, g-good job.

00:08:20.375 --> 00:08:22.958
M-My mustache! M-My mustache is...

00:08:22.958 --> 00:08:27.000
W-Well, before that,
I have all sorts of questions for you.

00:08:27.000 --> 00:08:31.208
What you asked for has already
been rolled out and is operating.

00:08:31.208 --> 00:08:33.792
It is complete and perfect. Right?

00:08:33.792 --> 00:08:35.333
Right?

00:08:35.333 --> 00:08:37.125
Where is she?

00:08:37.125 --> 00:08:39.958
She's probably
wandering around the area.

00:08:39.958 --> 00:08:41.250
What?

00:08:41.250 --> 00:08:43.667
I have inputted a basic personality.

00:08:43.667 --> 00:08:45.125
There is nothing to worry about.

00:08:45.125 --> 00:08:48.958
After all, she is
complete and perfect. Right?

00:08:48.958 --> 00:08:50.292
Right?

00:08:51.458 --> 00:08:53.500
What's with the "Right"?!

00:08:53.500 --> 00:08:55.875
You suddenly fished up
my daughter from a chopper!

00:08:55.875 --> 00:08:57.167
What were you thinking?!

00:08:57.167 --> 00:09:00.417
You have no common sense!
No common sense at all!

00:09:00.417 --> 00:09:02.542
Geniuses have no use
for such a thing as comm--

00:09:02.542 --> 00:09:05.875
Still making excuses?! Why, you!

00:09:08.208 --> 00:09:10.208
Please take care of the rest.

00:09:10.833 --> 00:09:12.500
Very good, Sir.

00:09:13.875 --> 00:09:15.750
"Department of City Security"

00:09:16.000 --> 00:09:20.000
Are you members of the
Department of City Security?

00:09:20.000 --> 00:09:22.500
Yeah, I guess that is what we're called.

00:09:22.500 --> 00:09:23.208
--Ma...

00:09:23.208 --> 00:09:24.500
--Pleased to meet you.
--Ma...

00:09:24.500 --> 00:09:25.500
Ma...

00:09:25.500 --> 00:09:26.500
Starting today,

00:09:26.500 --> 00:09:27.500
Ma...

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.208
I have been assigned to
the Department of City Security.

00:09:31.208 --> 00:09:32.792
My name is Ropponmatsu.

00:09:32.792 --> 00:09:34.583
L-L-L-Let's get married!

00:09:34.583 --> 00:09:36.208
Say, what's your first name?

00:09:36.208 --> 00:09:37.292
I do not have one yet.

00:09:37.292 --> 00:09:40.875
Your age? Your blood type?
Where are you from?

00:09:40.875 --> 00:09:42.333
They are undetermined.

00:09:42.333 --> 00:09:46.458
Are my questions
being skillfully dodged?

00:09:46.458 --> 00:09:46.833
--I only spoke the truth.

00:09:46.833 --> 00:09:48.375
--What is that?
--I only spoke the truth.

00:09:48.375 --> 00:09:50.250
Oh, come on.

00:09:50.250 --> 00:09:50.458
--Doesn't he think that it's strange?

00:09:50.458 --> 00:09:52.792
--Don't make a big deal about it, just tell me.
--Doesn't he think that it's strange?

00:09:52.792 --> 00:09:53.125
--But I really do not have one.

00:09:53.125 --> 00:09:54.667
--Probably not.
--But I really do not have one.

00:09:54.667 --> 00:09:55.167
The way you do that is cute too.

00:09:55.167 --> 00:09:57.083
"He's a fool."
The way you do that is cute too.

00:09:57.542 --> 00:09:58.792
Oh, well.

00:09:58.792 --> 00:10:03.208
Everyone, Ropponmatsu is
going to be our junior coworker.

00:10:03.208 --> 00:10:03.792
"Say."

00:10:03.792 --> 00:10:06.583
Oh, I'm so happy to
be with a beauty like you!

00:10:06.583 --> 00:10:07.875
"Don't you have any
thoughts on this situation?"

00:10:07.875 --> 00:10:11.000
I'm so lucky! Just kidding.

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.542
Not really.

00:10:15.833 --> 00:10:17.750
"Poor schmuck."

00:10:18.292 --> 00:10:20.958
Well, we organize
incomprehensible documents,

00:10:20.958 --> 00:10:22.917
go out into the area and
pick grass with our bare hands,

00:10:22.917 --> 00:10:24.667
and do boring jobs like that,

00:10:24.667 --> 00:10:28.125
but if there's anything you
don't understand, just ask me!

00:10:28.125 --> 00:10:31.542
Well, in this report of
April's budget reconciliation,

00:10:31.542 --> 00:10:33.333
there is a discrepancy in
the lower five digits.

00:10:33.333 --> 00:10:34.417
Oh, really?

00:10:34.417 --> 00:10:36.792
I might not look it,
but my calculating is...

00:10:42.083 --> 00:10:46.042
Ropponmatsu, if there's anything
you find out, just let me know.

00:10:46.042 --> 00:10:47.667
I have a question.

00:10:47.667 --> 00:10:49.333
W-What might that be?

00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:52.750
What is this "marriage"
that you spoke of earlier?

00:10:52.750 --> 00:10:54.250
What?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.208
Well, if I had to say,

00:10:56.208 --> 00:11:00.250
it's a life that guy is
kind of incapable of leading.

00:11:00.250 --> 00:11:02.583
I don't want to hear that from you!

00:11:02.583 --> 00:11:04.958
Hey, I'm complimenting you,
you lone wolf.

00:11:04.958 --> 00:11:06.667
What is the reason for his impotence?

00:11:06.667 --> 00:11:07.958
I'm not impotent!

00:11:07.958 --> 00:11:09.792
That's very immature of
you towards a new member.

00:11:09.792 --> 00:11:10.542
--And the one who called me
immature is the kid, you idiot!

00:11:10.542 --> 00:11:12.458
--Children.
--And the one who called me immature is the kid, you idiot!

00:11:12.458 --> 00:11:13.125
When did I ever say that?!

00:11:13.125 --> 00:11:13.792
"They're brats."
When did I ever say that?!

00:11:13.792 --> 00:11:16.333
What hour, minute,
and second did I say that?!

00:11:20.417 --> 00:11:20.458
"All you can eat!" "Cow dismembering show!!"

00:11:20.458 --> 00:11:21.250
"All you can eat!" "Cow dismembering show!!"
Here we are!

00:11:21.250 --> 00:11:22.792
"All you can eat!" "Cow dismembering show!!"
I found this place the other day.

00:11:22.792 --> 00:11:24.167
"All you can eat!" "Cow dismembering show!!"
Now that we're done with introductions,

00:11:24.167 --> 00:11:25.708
"All you can eat!" "Cow dismembering show!!"
let's eat, let's eat!

00:11:26.625 --> 00:11:28.625
Come on, let's go.

00:11:30.333 --> 00:11:32.333
Lose weight. Lose weight!

00:11:35.125 --> 00:11:36.000
"Low fat!!" "Healthy"
"Perfect for dieting!!"

00:11:42.458 --> 00:11:45.667
Sumiyoshi, don't let it bother you.

00:11:47.417 --> 00:11:50.500
The limit is 600 kilos
with a capacity of nine people.

00:11:50.500 --> 00:11:53.167
I wonder who the heavy one is?

00:11:53.167 --> 00:11:55.083
What does Iwata weigh?

00:11:55.083 --> 00:11:57.458
He was fasting again last night.

00:12:09.750 --> 00:12:12.667
Duty! Errands! Delivery!

00:12:12.667 --> 00:12:15.042
The same three points
that came up before.

00:12:15.042 --> 00:12:16.875
Running errands, running errands.

00:12:16.875 --> 00:12:22.167
Running errands is
an underling's specialty!

00:12:22.167 --> 00:12:27.583
By the way, please no jabs
about how I got back, thank you!

00:12:27.583 --> 00:12:33.000
Or rather, my memory from
around that time is kind of hazy.

00:12:33.000 --> 00:12:34.958
Hang in there, Excel!

00:12:34.958 --> 00:12:37.500
Damn, she's swallowed a ton of water!

00:12:37.500 --> 00:12:39.958
Guess I got not choice.

00:12:47.708 --> 00:12:50.833
What? No. What was
that French kiss scene?

00:12:50.833 --> 00:12:54.375
No! No, no, I will
unilaterally not think about it!

00:12:54.375 --> 00:12:57.125
Senior, that is our precious package,

00:12:57.125 --> 00:13:00.208
so perhaps we should
treat it with more care?

00:13:00.208 --> 00:13:02.042
That's true.
Come to think of it, Hatchan,

00:13:02.042 --> 00:13:04.750
Lord Ilpalazzo told you
the delivery destination, right?

00:13:04.750 --> 00:13:06.167
--Oh, yes, but more importantly...

00:13:06.167 --> 00:13:08.750
--Then I'll count on you  for directions! Let's La Go!
--Oh, yes, but more importantly...

00:13:08.750 --> 00:13:10.417
This way, right!

00:13:11.875 --> 00:13:13.583
This way, left!

00:13:15.333 --> 00:13:16.917
This way, left!

00:13:16.917 --> 00:13:19.125
And then left...

00:13:21.583 --> 00:13:23.625
So, where's our destination?

00:13:23.625 --> 00:13:28.458
Well, the scenery has changed into
something I did not expect.

00:13:28.458 --> 00:13:31.417
What?! We came just like you said!

00:13:31.417 --> 00:13:36.833
We turned right there!
Next, left! And then...

00:13:39.458 --> 00:13:41.333
I give up.

00:13:41.333 --> 00:13:45.000
Oh, boy, oh, boy, I planted a seed.

00:13:45.000 --> 00:13:47.125
Running errands is harder than I thought.

00:13:47.125 --> 00:13:49.667
I guess you can't make a
living off of just physical stamina.

00:13:49.667 --> 00:13:52.167
Please excuse me for a moment.

00:13:52.167 --> 00:13:53.292
What? Bathroom?

00:13:53.292 --> 00:13:56.958
You have tissue, right?
Flush properly! And wash your hands!

00:13:56.958 --> 00:13:59.667
Oh, the weather is so great.

00:13:59.667 --> 00:14:01.667
I wonder what Menchi is doing?

00:14:04.292 --> 00:14:05.792
"Supreme Bliss"

00:14:06.208 --> 00:14:08.167
I wonder if Hatchan's done yet?

00:14:08.167 --> 00:14:10.875
I can't complete the errand
if she doesn't come back soon.

00:14:10.875 --> 00:14:13.625
If I can't complete the errand,
Lord Ilpalazzo will...

00:14:19.792 --> 00:14:25.333
Hatchan! If that was the case,
just hurry up and say so!

00:14:27.333 --> 00:14:29.333
Man, I'm stuffed!

00:14:29.333 --> 00:14:32.500
But you know, you eat
like a bird, Ropponmatsu.

00:14:32.500 --> 00:14:33.333
Well...

00:14:33.333 --> 00:14:36.000
She didn't eat anything.

00:14:36.000 --> 00:14:38.250
That's good because it's
easy on the family finances.

00:14:38.250 --> 00:14:39.958
"What're you talkin' about?"

00:14:39.958 --> 00:14:42.042
By the way, since we're done eating,

00:14:42.042 --> 00:14:43.625
why don't you guys go back?

00:14:43.625 --> 00:14:47.083
It's just too dangerous
to leave her with you.

00:14:47.917 --> 00:14:50.333
So, that's how you're
going to respond.

00:14:50.333 --> 00:14:51.667
Look.

00:14:53.667 --> 00:14:55.167
Miss Ayasugi!

00:14:55.167 --> 00:14:56.292
What's wrong?

00:14:56.292 --> 00:14:59.458
Well, everyone,
I've got some stuff to take care of,

00:14:59.458 --> 00:15:01.833
so go on back without me.

00:15:02.792 --> 00:15:03.875
Go for it, man.

00:15:03.875 --> 00:15:05.250
You too.

00:15:06.750 --> 00:15:07.292
What was that?

00:15:07.292 --> 00:15:08.000
"Who knows?"

00:15:10.750 --> 00:15:12.500
Miss Ayasugi...

00:15:12.500 --> 00:15:13.833
M-Mr. Watanabe?

00:15:13.833 --> 00:15:16.208
You don't look so well.

00:15:16.208 --> 00:15:19.542
Thank you so much for
always worrying about me.

00:15:19.542 --> 00:15:22.125
Y-You want to go rest somewhere?

00:15:22.125 --> 00:15:23.458
Thank you...

00:15:23.583 --> 00:15:24.375
"Crash!!"

00:15:30.083 --> 00:15:31.375
Something just ended.

00:15:31.375 --> 00:15:35.167
I feel something slimy on my back!

00:15:35.167 --> 00:15:37.000
It's seeping through, it's seeping
through! It's uncomfortable!

00:15:37.000 --> 00:15:39.208
A slimy feeling!
A seeping feeling!

00:15:39.208 --> 00:15:42.208
Please reset, Great Will of the Macrocosm!

00:15:44.375 --> 00:15:45.000
"Mr. Pe"

00:15:45.000 --> 00:15:46.375
Mr. Pe...

00:15:48.083 --> 00:15:50.375
I was wrong, wasn't I?

00:15:50.375 --> 00:15:53.167
I had him, but I let you...

00:15:53.167 --> 00:15:57.042
If I'd only known, I would
have just revived you earlier.

00:15:57.042 --> 00:15:59.958
That way, you wouldn't have
had to die again.

00:15:59.958 --> 00:16:02.500
I... As a woman...

00:16:02.500 --> 00:16:05.667
Right! As a woman, to me, Mr. Pe is...

00:16:05.667 --> 00:16:07.167
Mr. Pe!

00:16:08.167 --> 00:16:10.917
Macrocosm, you idiot!

00:16:10.917 --> 00:16:15.208
And so, I swore in my heart
that I would protect this town.

00:16:15.208 --> 00:16:18.708
That's how I became a member
of the Department of City Security.

00:16:18.708 --> 00:16:19.917
A very admirable attitude.

00:16:19.917 --> 00:16:23.125
What?! Really?!
Looks like we'll get along great!

00:16:23.125 --> 00:16:24.250
Yes.

00:16:24.250 --> 00:16:26.917
I'm so happy, no one's
ever said that to me before.

00:16:26.917 --> 00:16:28.125
They look good together.

00:16:28.125 --> 00:16:29.625
"Does it bother you?"

00:16:29.625 --> 00:16:32.583
We are the Department of City Security.

00:16:32.583 --> 00:16:34.083
You know what that means, don't you?

00:16:34.083 --> 00:16:35.458
"I see, that's down to Earth."

00:16:35.708 --> 00:16:37.792
Hey! I heard there's something freaky!

00:16:37.792 --> 00:16:40.417
It's all bloody, right?!
Call the police! The police!

00:16:42.667 --> 00:16:44.500
"Spectator"
Let's go, Ropponmatsu!

00:16:44.500 --> 00:16:47.042
"Spectator"
We may get to see something fun.

00:16:47.042 --> 00:16:48.958
"Bereavement Room"

00:16:59.125 --> 00:17:03.167
Oh, why does Hatchan have to cross
over once before she'll come back?

00:17:03.167 --> 00:17:04.542
It's a mystery.

00:17:04.542 --> 00:17:07.250
Good morning, Senior Excel.

00:17:11.500 --> 00:17:14.167
There's definitely a box-like
thing that's covered in blood.

00:17:14.167 --> 00:17:15.542
It's certainly bizarre.

00:17:15.542 --> 00:17:16.708
I have interest in it.

00:17:16.708 --> 00:17:19.000
Hey, could it be, could it be?
Do you like horror?

00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:20.583
--I like horror quite a bit too. I just feel so much sympathy.

00:17:20.583 --> 00:17:23.458
--Situation understood.
--I like horror quite a bit too. I just feel so much sympathy.

00:17:23.458 --> 00:17:25.583
I just happen to be running near there.

00:17:25.583 --> 00:17:28.667
Sir, we must regulate traffic
and advise an evacuation.

00:17:28.667 --> 00:17:32.167
Yes, Momoji, take care of
that along with information control.

00:17:32.167 --> 00:17:34.833
I will head to the site
since it sounds like fun.

00:17:34.833 --> 00:17:36.625
Please do that.

00:17:40.042 --> 00:17:41.083
Senior Iwata...

00:17:41.083 --> 00:17:42.167
Go ahead.

00:17:42.167 --> 00:17:43.917
Please listen to me calmly.

00:17:43.917 --> 00:17:46.583
There is a time bomb inside that box.

00:17:47.208 --> 00:17:51.833
What?! That's a bomb?!

00:17:54.583 --> 00:17:55.000
"Crunch"

00:17:55.542 --> 00:17:57.333
Is it really a bomb?

00:17:57.333 --> 00:17:59.125
Yes, there is no mistake about it.

00:17:59.125 --> 00:18:00.667
I don't understand the logic of it,

00:18:00.667 --> 00:18:03.333
but with the blood all over it,
there's a sense of realism to it.

00:18:03.333 --> 00:18:07.625
Senior Matsuya,
please keep the crowd away.

00:18:07.625 --> 00:18:09.167
Mr. Kabapu will also be here soon.

00:18:09.167 --> 00:18:10.542
What are you going to do?

00:18:10.542 --> 00:18:13.875
Wait, how do you know all that?

00:18:13.875 --> 00:18:17.208
Looks like I'd better trust
her in this case.

00:18:17.208 --> 00:18:20.708
Oh, Ropponmatsu is...
You go instead of her!

00:18:20.708 --> 00:18:22.250
"<i>You </i>go."

00:18:22.250 --> 00:18:25.500
I'm asking her to sacrifice
herself for our future!

00:18:31.875 --> 00:18:32.750
Sir!

00:18:32.750 --> 00:18:36.042
You need not say anything.
I already know the situation.

00:18:36.042 --> 00:18:37.583
There is no need to worry.

00:18:37.583 --> 00:18:40.208
"He really came."
Sir, Ropponmatsu is going off by herself!

00:18:40.208 --> 00:18:41.542
She is? I see.

00:18:41.542 --> 00:18:45.250
It's okay, she's an expert in this field.

00:18:45.250 --> 00:18:48.417
Ropponmatsu, Kabapu here.
How does it look?

00:18:51.125 --> 00:18:53.917
Optical sensor, vibration sensor,

00:18:53.917 --> 00:18:56.458
and timer are all operating normally.

00:18:56.458 --> 00:18:58.667
I see, how gorgeous.

00:18:58.667 --> 00:19:00.542
The timer has 112 seconds left to go.

00:19:00.542 --> 00:19:02.083
In favor of everyone
evacuating immediately.

00:19:02.083 --> 00:19:03.000
Aye!

00:19:03.000 --> 00:19:04.792
I leave it in your hands.
Take care of it.

00:19:04.792 --> 00:19:08.167
What?! Run, Ropponmatsu!

00:19:10.917 --> 00:19:11.625
Oh, no, please!

00:19:11.625 --> 00:19:12.167
"Idiot."
Oh, no, please!

00:19:17.125 --> 00:19:20.333
Optical sensor deactivated.

00:19:20.333 --> 00:19:22.167
Vibration sensor deactivated.

00:19:22.167 --> 00:19:23.583
I wouldn't have it any other way.

00:19:23.583 --> 00:19:24.458
--Wow, that's awesome!

00:19:24.458 --> 00:19:25.583
--She's too fast!
--Wow, that's awesome!

00:19:25.583 --> 00:19:28.958
Commencing analysis and removal
of timer and triggering device.

00:19:28.958 --> 00:19:30.958
Do it. You have thirty seconds left.

00:19:30.958 --> 00:19:33.625
I don't really understand,
but go Ropponmatsu!

00:19:33.625 --> 00:19:35.500
"We're becoming unnecessary."

00:19:35.500 --> 00:19:40.417
Shioji, I will test your
perfection and completion.

00:19:48.000 --> 00:19:49.375
Timer removed.

00:19:49.375 --> 00:19:52.000
It will be finished once the wire
to the triggering device is severed.

00:19:52.000 --> 00:19:52.917
Good work.

00:19:52.917 --> 00:19:55.500
Awesome! It's like a movie!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:20:00.208
5... 4... 3... 2... 1...

00:20:00.208 --> 00:20:02.750
Ropponmatsu!

00:20:05.167 --> 00:20:06.792
Senior!

00:20:06.792 --> 00:20:09.500
Senior? Senior Iwata?

00:20:09.500 --> 00:20:11.958
Won't you come to the pool with me?

00:20:13.958 --> 00:20:17.375
Oh, please, don't stare at me.
It's embarrassing.

00:20:17.375 --> 00:20:19.500
That swimsuit looks very good on you.

00:20:19.500 --> 00:20:23.167
When you look at me,
I feel that's all I ever...

00:20:25.875 --> 00:20:27.542
Senior Iwata,

00:20:28.458 --> 00:20:32.167
I'm just so happy,
I think my circuits are going to short.

00:20:32.167 --> 00:20:33.208
Me too.

00:20:33.208 --> 00:20:36.167
Senior, please register me.

00:20:36.167 --> 00:20:38.208
Put me away in your folder

00:20:38.208 --> 00:20:41.208
and shut me away
with a password just for me.

00:21:07.542 --> 00:21:10.917
Roppon... matsu...

00:21:12.292 --> 00:21:15.917
Excel, please tell me
why your report is late.

00:21:15.917 --> 00:21:19.500
Well, from your perspective, right is left,

00:21:19.500 --> 00:21:21.583
and from my perspective,
it's the opposite.

00:21:21.583 --> 00:21:24.833
Hey, that was super fast today!

00:21:27.542 --> 00:21:29.833
"Pleasure"

00:21:32.917 --> 00:21:35.500
"Department of City Security"

00:21:38.750 --> 00:21:40.375
Ropponmatsu!

00:21:40.375 --> 00:21:44.083
I won't forget you.
We won't forget about you!

00:21:44.083 --> 00:21:45.750
Right, everyone?!

00:21:48.917 --> 00:21:50.083
You're al...

00:21:50.083 --> 00:21:51.833
You're al...

00:21:51.833 --> 00:21:55.417
You're alive, Ropponmatsu!

00:21:56.833 --> 00:22:00.958
Well, I'm sorry to have worried you.
I've been fixed.

00:22:00.958 --> 00:22:02.792
I'm Ropponmatsu!

00:22:05.500 --> 00:22:07.292
Ropponmatsu...

00:22:07.292 --> 00:22:09.625
"She sure's become a lot smaller."

00:22:09.792 --> 00:22:11.792
Nice to meet you!

00:22:12.958 --> 00:22:14.792
Who the hell are you?!

00:22:14.792 --> 00:22:17.625
"Episode 14: Prop"

00:22:17.625 --> 00:22:19.625
"Episode 14: Prop"
"Today's Experiment..."

00:22:19.625 --> 00:22:21.500
"Episode 14: Prop"
"Today's Experiment... Failed"

00:22:22.167 --> 00:22:23.958
That's no good.

00:22:50.917 --> 00:22:59.333
<i>I knew, ever since that day</i>

00:22:59.333 --> 00:23:06.750
<i>The reason you had approached me</i>

00:23:06.750 --> 00:23:14.833
<i>Tender and soft</i>

00:23:14.833 --> 00:23:23.625
<i>That my body is to your taste</i>

00:23:24.583 --> 00:23:32.375
<i>To your hunger-stricken eyes</i>

00:23:32.375 --> 00:23:40.250
<i>How does my body seem</i>

00:23:40.250 --> 00:23:48.125
<i>If you are to eat me, do it in one blow</i>

00:23:48.125 --> 00:23:56.875
<i>So that the meat does not get hard</i>

00:23:59.042 --> 00:24:00.542
We thought of propping things up,

00:24:00.542 --> 00:24:02.333
but various things
are in a predicament.

00:24:02.333 --> 00:24:04.292
In this Oshishi Mask situation,
we had Prop One for some hustle,

00:24:04.292 --> 00:24:05.875
but it suffered an
unbelievably honorable death!

00:24:05.875 --> 00:24:07.542
In other words,
we were unable to prop things up!

00:24:07.542 --> 00:24:08.750
Since it's come to this,
we have no choice

00:24:08.750 --> 00:24:09.917
but to bury it under that
legendary tree

00:24:09.917 --> 00:24:11.250
and open the little vanity box
like a time capsule.

00:24:11.250 --> 00:24:12.583
Sort of on graduation day.

00:24:12.583 --> 00:24:14.292
But, but, I wonder
what's in that little box?

00:24:14.292 --> 00:24:16.417
A pretty green-haired girl?
A silent mysterious character?

00:24:16.417 --> 00:24:18.500
A mystery human-shaped robot?
Close, but it's a secret!

00:24:18.500 --> 00:24:20.375
Because if my friends start gossiping,
it's embarrassing.

00:24:20.375 --> 00:24:22.542
We have come to even
include such jokes at my expense!

00:24:22.542 --> 00:24:23.917
Quack Experimental Animation,
Excel Saga!

00:24:23.917 --> 00:24:25.542
Next time, "More! Prop Memorial"!

00:24:25.542 --> 00:24:28.594
More propping!
That's the best we can do right now!
